Copyright 2023 Commit Mono authors (https://github.com/eigilnikolajsen/commit-mono)

This file is a subset of commit_mono, made by "kerneltool vector_fonts" (docs/FONTS.md):
the characters 32 to 126 and the glyph .notdef, each glyph a simple glyph
(0 glyphs made of glyphs were made simple), no hinting instructions, no
OpenType layout tables. The subset carries the name "CommitMono ASCII".
License of the source: SIL OFL 1.1 in the font file; MIT in its repository.

The text of the license in the source font file:

This Font Software is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. This license is available with a FAQ at: https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

URL of the license: https://scripts.sil.org/OFL
The full text of the license: OFL.txt, in this folder.
